=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AZV6lTm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Yc3s8na.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iqjbhOr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sy21BTe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4uSaqGJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AEX6ikk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hK2Ne4q.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OofG9DM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/u6uA7Yo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wm2UCet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Cw074li.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/2j5X6pZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DXcKlJf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vTsTyrz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mQgIVDu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5xXqhXe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kVHzJV9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cYHSkb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GuGTe3L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pcmP0xG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\" /><br /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xyN0hmi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">合併附魔是一個模組，讓你可以混合、排除附魔，甚至將所有東西結合在一起。一些例子包括：鋒利、不死剋星與節肢剋星，所有類型的保護（火焰、爆炸、投射物），絲綢之觸與幸運，波濤與忠誠/喚雷，緻密、破甲、不死剋星與節肢剋星。請查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki\">Wiki</a>了解配置的運作方式，你可以設定<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\">黑名單</a>以及<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\">合併所有東西</a>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/H9nhuOr.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"233\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/l717aDK.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"234\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：它能與其他模組的附魔一起運作嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：自3.0版本起，它可以合併所有原版及外部模組的附魔。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：我要如何同時獲得<span style=\"color: #008000;\">絲綢之觸</span>與<span style=\"color: #99cc00;\">幸運</span>？</strong><br />答：你需要安裝合併附魔和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toggle-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">切換附魔</a>。<br /><strong>問：我要如何讓<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">波濤</span>搭配<span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">忠誠</span>與<span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">喚雷</span>？</strong><br />答：你需要安裝合併附魔和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-trident-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">改良三叉戟附魔</a>。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：我可以在我的模組包中包含合併附魔嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：當然可以，只需將我的模組放入相關專案中即可。</span></li>\n</ul>",
